---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import ClosingCTA from '../components/ClosingCTA.astro';
import { socials } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Rohit Kumar | Founder & Builder" description="I’m Rohit Kumar, founder of Leadomi. I build software and digital products that solve business problems, using AI and modern tools when they help.">
  <section class="about-hero page-shell"><div class="about-hero-copy"><p class="section-kicker" data-reveal>About / My story</p><h1 data-reveal>I'm a founder.<br /><em>Always building.</em></h1><p data-reveal>I run a business and build products. Three years of development and freelance work have taught me to learn quickly and turn real business needs into useful software.</p><div class="about-links" data-reveal>{socials.map((social) => <a href={social.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{social.label} <Icon name="external" /></a>)}</div></div><div class="about-portrait" data-reveal><img src="/images/rohit.webp" alt="Rohit Kumar" fetchpriority="high" /><div class="about-portrait-note">LEARNING FAST<br />BUILDING DAILY <span>↗</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="about-story page-shell"><div class="story-label" data-reveal><p class="section-kicker"><span>01</span> How I build</p><span>LEARN BY BUILDING</span></div><div class="story-body" data-reveal><h2>I stay close to the work.</h2><p>I’ve spent three years developing software and freelancing. That work spans product decisions, customer needs, and the details that make a solution useful. I’m always learning, then putting those lessons into something real.</p><p>I founded <a href="https://leadomi.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Leadomi</a> and created <a href="https://otpwala.me" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">OTP Wala</a>. I stay close to the business problem, the product, and the technology behind it.</p><p>AI and modern development tools help me research, prototype, and automate repeat work when they move a business forward.</p><div class="about-quickfacts" aria-label="My experience at a glance"><div><strong>22</strong><span>Years old</span></div><div><strong>03</strong><span>Years building</span></div><div><strong>02</strong><span>Products built</span></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="principles-section page-shell"><div data-reveal><p class="section-kicker"><span>02</span> How I work</p><h2>Stay curious.<br /><em>Keep shipping.</em></h2></div><div class="principle-grid"><article data-reveal><span>01 / Listen</span><h3>Find what’s stuck.</h3><p>I start with your business problem and the people it affects.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>02 / Learn</span><h3>Choose tools that fit.</h3><p>I keep learning about AI and modern tools, then use what fits the job.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>03 / Build</span><h3>Make it ready to launch.</h3><p>I bring product thinking, software, and connected systems together in a solution built to ship.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="education-row page-shell" data-reveal><div><p class="section-kicker"><span>03</span> Education & experience</p><h2>Learning never stops.<br /><em>Neither does building.</em></h2></div><div class="education-items"><article><span>COMPLETED</span><strong>Bachelor of Computer Applications</strong><small>BCA graduate</small></article><article><span>IN PROGRESS</span><strong>Master of Computer Applications</strong><small>MCA candidate</small></article><article><span>IN PRACTICE</span><strong>Web development & freelancing</strong><small>3 years of experience</small></article></div></section>
  <ClosingCTA number="04" />
</BaseLayout>
